BYD Co.)的主要投資者。\n（本文譯自MarketWatch）\n（本文版權歸道瓊斯公司所有，未經許可不得翻譯或轉載。）\n更多精彩文章：\n美議員敦促就新疆拘留營問題制裁中國官員\n中國中產階層崛起令「日本製造」再度風行\n本土電池質量不達標，通用汽車推遲在華電動車生產計劃\n中國國務院公布人民幣450億元減稅計劃\n軟銀決定不投資蔚來汽車IPO", "external_links": ["https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BIZ-20180830143528&quot;", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BIZ-20180830175756&quot;", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BIZ-20180830071235", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-CEC-20180831072751", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BCH-20180830103213&quot;", "https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/9Z58zfG2tE50cUOm9Q1yJQ--~A/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjtzbT0xO3c9NjE3O2g9MzQ3/http://media.zenfs.com/en/homerun/feed_manager_auto_publish_494/98193662659748a1f7c6c8284370795f", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-CEC-20180831072751&quot;", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BIZ-20180830175756", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BCH-20180830103213", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BIZ-20180830143528", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BIZ-20180830071235&quot;"], "published": "2018-08-31T13:21:00.000+03:00", "crawled": "2018-08-31T13:11:00.005+03:00", "highlightTitle": ""}